title: Fuse two agents for a mission?
pid: 8b32209e-6420-4b67-862d-de141dfc1721
body: |2-
  Right now we're asking Tracy to investigate a bug,
  and then Drew will fix it. But once Tracy investigates it,
  she's learned a lot about its machinery, and Drew will have to relearn that.
  It might be more efficient if, for that mission,
  a Tracy-Drew agent came into being, knowing what both know.
